<title>UK: Canada plans dollar bond next week -bankers.</title>
<headline>Canada plans dollar bond next week -bankers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada plans to issue a dollar bond aimed at Japanese retail investors for up to $500 million next week, bankers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The deal was expected to have a three- to four-year maturity. Yamaichi was tipped as lead manager.</p>
<p>-- Aline van Duyn, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
